    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -720,
        "y": 300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Switch forwards one of its inputs, picked by selector, and Reduce folds a list into one value. Both CSVReaders read Iris and output one column as a list of 150 numbers: petal length on input_0, sepal length on input_1. With selector 0 the mean petal length is 3.758 cm, the shortest 1.0 and the longest 6.9. Set selector to 1 and the same Reduce nodes report sepal length: 5.843, 4.3 and 7.9. The fourth Reduce stacks the list into a tensor for the histogram.\n\nSwitch 依 selector 從多個輸入中轉送一個，Reduce 把一個串列摺疊成單一數值。兩個 CSVReader 都讀 Iris，各輸出一個欄位，是 150 個數字的串列：input_0 是花瓣長度，input_1 是花萼長度。selector 為 0 時，花瓣長度的平均是 3.758 公分，最短 1.0，最長 6.9。把 selector 改成 1，同樣的 Reduce 節點就改為回報花萼長度：5.843、4.3 與 7.9。第四個 Reduce 把串列堆疊成張量，畫成直方圖。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-switch",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "A selector set in the param is known before the run starts, so the run leaves out what feeds only the inputs it does not pick: with selector 0 the sepal CSVReader never runs. Wire a number into the selector port instead and the choice is made during the run, so every wired input is computed first.\n\nselector 寫在參數裡時，執行開始前就已知道選哪一個，所以只餵給未選輸入的節點會被略過：selector 為 0 時，讀花萼的 CSVReader 不會執行。若改把數值接到 selector 埠，選擇會在執行中才決定，所有接上的輸入都會先算出來。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "switch",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
